                expected = λ`_`."# hydra.testInput.prim\n\n<!-- Note: this is an automatically generated file. Do not edit. -->\n\n## hydra.testInput.prim.example\n\nA trivial constant primitive\n\n`string`\n\n**[HYDRA-TEST-INPUT-PRIM-EXAMPLE-CONSTANT-VALUE] (requirement) **This primitive always returns the same string value."}},
